              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Users land on the drillthrough page and cannot return without knowing the Ctrl/Alt shortcut."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "How to verify: `pageBinding.type: Drillthrough` page with no actionButton of type Back.\nFix: Add a Back button (Insert > Buttons > Back).",
                "markdown": "**How to verify:** `pageBinding.type: Drillthrough` page with no actionButton of type Back.\n\n**Fix:** Add a Back button (Insert > Buttons > Back)."
