            {
              "id": "IN-13",
              "name": "YearSlicerExposesFutureYears",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Year slicer exposes future years"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "When the date table extends past the current year (for forecasts), a year slicer lists empty future years and users pick them by mistake."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "How to verify: Slicer on a year column of a date table whose definition reaches beyond the current year, with no visual, page or report filter on the date table.\nFix: Add a visual-level filter (e.g. an `Is Past or Current Year` flag) or trim the slicer values.",
                "markdown": "**How to verify:** Slicer on a year column of a date table whose definition reaches beyond the current year, with no visual, page or report filter on the date table.\n\n**Fix:** Add a visual-level filter (e.g. an `Is Past or Current Year` flag) or trim the slicer values."
              },
              "helpUri": "https://learn.microsoft.com/power-bi/guidance/model-date-tables",
              "defaultConfiguration": {
