              "help": {
                "text": "How to verify: No `mobile.json` files in the report.\nFix: Create a mobile layout for the pages that mobile users open.",
                "markdown": "**How to verify:** No `mobile.json` files in the report.\n\n**Fix:** Create a mobile layout for the pages that mobile users open."
