              "name": "OneToOneRelationship",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "One-to-one relationship"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "One-to-one relationships usually mean two tables that should be merged; they also make filter direction harder to reason about."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "How to verify: `fromCardinality: one` and `toCardinality: one` on the same relationship.\nFix: Merge the tables in Power Query, or document why they stay separate.",
                "markdown": "**How to verify:** `fromCardinality: one` and `toCardinality: one` on the same relationship.\n\n**Fix:** Merge the tables in Power Query, or document why they stay separate."
