            {
              "id": "MOD-05",
              "name": "AutoDateTimeIsEnabled",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Auto date/time is enabled"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Auto date/time creates a hidden LocalDateTable per date column, inflating model size and producing inconsistent time intelligence."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "How to verify: `annotation __PBI_TimeIntelligenceEnabled = 1` in model.tmdl or `LocalDateTable_*` tables.\nFix: Disable Auto date/time in the file options and use one shared, marked date table.",
                "markdown": "**How to verify:** `annotation __PBI_TimeIntelligenceEnabled = 1` in model.tmdl or `LocalDateTable_*` tables.\n\n**Fix:** Disable Auto date/time in the file options and use one shared, marked date table."
              },
