              "name": "ForeignKeyColumnIsVisible",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Foreign-key column is visible"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Visible key columns invite users to slice by the fact-side key instead of the dimension attribute, which bypasses the dimension."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "How to verify: Columns used on the many side of a relationship without `isHidden`.\nFix: Hide foreign-key columns in the fact table.",
                "markdown": "**How to verify:** Columns used on the many side of a relationship without `isHidden`.\n\n**Fix:** Hide foreign-key columns in the fact table."
