            {
              "id": "MOD-09",
              "name": "ImplicitMeasuresAreNotDiscouraged",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Implicit measures are not discouraged"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Without `discourageImplicitMeasures`, users drag raw numeric columns and get default sums that bypass business logic and confuse Copilot."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "How to verify: `discourageImplicitMeasures` missing from model.tmdl.\nFix: Enable it (it is required for calculation groups anyway) and expose explicit measures.",
                "markdown": "**How to verify:** `discourageImplicitMeasures` missing from model.tmdl.\n\n**Fix:** Enable it (it is required for calculation groups anyway) and expose explicit measures."
