              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Each data visual sends at least one query; busy pages render slowly and overload the reader. There is no official limit; the default threshold is 12 data-bound visuals."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "How to verify: Count visible, data-bound visuals per page (`--max-visuals`).\nFix: Split the page, use a multi-row card or a small multiple, or move detail to drillthrough.",
                "markdown": "**How to verify:** Count visible, data-bound visuals per page (`--max-visuals`).\n\n**Fix:** Split the page, use a multi-row card or a small multiple, or move detail to drillthrough."
